<title>USA: First Nat'l Bank of Commerce may issue 3-yr debt.</title>
<headline>First Nat'l Bank of Commerce may issue 3-yr debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>First National Bank of Commerce is expected to issue $250 million in three-year debt via lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co, syndicate sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The offering is expected to consist of a three-year maturity and is expected to be launched as early as Thursday, sources added.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675</p>
</text>
